pi.github.com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":131700401,"digest":"sha256:a6c4da18dad332dc98b907d6fd9308f2f8eded71dba14fbc8e8d389b5f714ed4","download_count":183,"created_at":"2026-06-23T14:36:42Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T14:38:18Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.5.5/Advancely-v1.5.5-Windows.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/tarball/v1.5.5","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/zipball/v1.5.5","body":"## The legendary [ScrambledMC](https://www.twitch.tv/scrambledmc) not only added two new `_categorical` templates (`1.16.2` and `1.17`), but also significantly updated all of the others as well as suggested a few handy features that are now implemented.\r\n\r\n# The new features/additions include, but are not limited to:\r\n- Added Support for Minecraft 26.4 already.\r\n\r\n### Template Editor\r\n\r\n-  `Manual Layout` checkbox is locked why the Visual Layout Editor is active and its previous state is restored afterwards.\r\n- Selecting and dragging a goal together with its text no longer applies independent positioning. Dragging the child without the parent then adds the positioning as expected.\r\n- Pressing X on any search bar now properly reselects it.\r\n- A stage can now be skipped if the next one is somehow completed (useful for trading for shells or getting trident through chest).\r\n- TAB now properly cycles through the fields within multi-stage goal stages.\r\n- Within the `Advancements` tab it now displays the count of Recipes and Advancements individually.\r\n\r\n### Linked Goals\r\n\r\n- A goal can no longer be linked to itself.\r\n- Added a `Remove All` option for linked goals.\r\n- `Always On Top` now defaults to off.\r\n\r\n### Template Changes\r\n- `1.21.11` and `26.1` now share identical `all_advancements` templates.\r\n- New Templates: `1.16.2` and `1.17` `all_advancements` `_categorical` templates.\r\n<img width=\"1770\" height=\"1127\" alt=\"1 16 2 categorical template\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6a84e1b-805a-4bf3-bf60-425a92c50b03\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1898\" height=\"1132\" alt=\"1 17 categorical template\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0739e122-6a72-414d-8914-c28e40a618bb\" />\r\n\r\n- Other categorical templates were updated. (`1.12`, `26.1`, `26.2`)\r\n\r\n### Textures\r\n\r\n- Added 4 new old-block textures for the `1.12` `_categorical` template along with an old animated notch texture.\r\n- Added many old spawn egg textures.\r\n- Added new end-screen emotes.\r\n\r\n### Fixes\r\n\r\n- Custom manual progress now transfers properly when loading a settings preset.\r\n\r\n### Credits\r\n\r\n- Linking to ScrambledMCs twitch and [Oskars](https://www.youtube.com/@Oskar-Meinkraft) YouTube within the README.md file instead.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [tracker main page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome\\! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update\\!"}